@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/forfeit-as-loss.puml
' purpose: StarChess Leave Match writes a loss — not a void, not a draw
' status: proposed 2026-09-17, not implemented; product = StarChess
' covers: apps/starchess/src/components/features/ExitGameConfirm.tsx
'         apps/starchess/src/screens/SingleScreen.tsx
'         apps/starchess/src/store/matchHistoryStore.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/store/matchSessionStore.ts
' live spec: _spec/apps/starchess/menu-flow.puml
'   draw cap that must stay distinct .... _spec/_plans/turn-45-draw-stop.puml
'   analytics that will ingest the result _spec/_plans/chess-analytics.puml
'   export that must copy the same enum . _spec/_plans/game-export-localstorage.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' ── WHAT THE LINE ITEM SETTLES ─────────────────────────────────────────────
' Leave during a live /single match is an OUTCOME write. The leaving player
' loses; the Adjutant wins. ""resultForPlayer"" / ""recordFromMatchState""
' already know win|loss|draw — they are never called on Home today.
'
' ── WHAT IT DOES NOT SETTLE ────────────────────────────────────────────────
'   Coach resign (already a loss in apps/chess)
'   timeout vs leave as separate reasons
'   tutorial HOME (TutorialScreen.goHome)
'   folding this into ""scOutcome"" (HP / turn-45 only)
title PLANNED — StarChess leave writes a loss;\nprogress-lost is a void

component "ExitGameConfirm\nLeave Match" as QUIT <<error>>
component "SingleScreen.exitToMenu" as EXIT <<app>>
component "recordFromMatchState\nresultForPlayer" as REC <<app>>
database "starchess_match_history" as HIST <<db>>
database "starchess_match_session" as SES <<db>>
component "scOutcome\nHP · MAX_GAME_TURNS" as ENG <<app>>
component "**void the match**\nprogress will be lost" as VOID <<error>>

QUIT ARROW_MAIN EXIT
EXIT ARROW_ERROR VOID : today · ""clearMatchSession""
EXIT ARROW_OPTIONAL REC : this plan
REC ARROW_MAIN HIST : result = 'loss'
REC ARROW_MAIN SES : then clear
ENG ARROW_OPTIONAL HIST : engine terminals only

note bottom of VOID
  **Home today drops the resume blob
  and writes no row.** Ratings and
  analytics cannot recover an unwritten
  loss after ""onCleanup"" runs.
end note

note bottom of REC
  **One writer: the same functions the
  gameOver effect already uses.** Set
  a conceding outcome, then persist.
  Do not invent a second enum.
end note

note right of ENG
  **""scOutcome"" stays HP and the turn
  cap.** Leave is an app verb on
  ""ExitGameConfirm"", not a resolver
  terminal.
end note

legend bottom
  **The order to do it in**
  ==
  **1. Confirm today's void.** ""exitToMenu"" and
  ""MatchInner onCleanup"" only call ""clearMatchSession"".
  Coach ""resign"" is out of scope.
  --
  **2. Map leave → loss in one place.** Conceding
  side loses, Adjutant wins, reason may stay
  leave/forfeit for replay copy.
  ==
  **3. Point history at that write.** Export and
  analytics read ""StarChessGameRecord.result"".
  Turn-45 stays ""scOutcome""; do not fold it in.
  --
  **Left open**: timeout vs leave; tutorial HOME;
  whether copy says resign, quit, or forfeit.
end legend
@enduml
